    {
      "fileName": "kaiju-stance.json",
      "id": "RwOGkOLCalt4sqz6",
      "name": "Kaiju Stance",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "RwOGkOLCalt4sqz6",
        "folder": "vIv76ARzujbUOS1T",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Kaiju Stance",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Access</strong> You've encountered a kaiju and survived.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're unarmored.</p><hr /><p>Your encounter with one of the rare forces of nature known as kaiju has imbued you with knowledge of a martial art that allows you to emulate a fraction of their power. When you enter Kaiju Stance, you become Large and are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1}. The only Strikes you can make are shattering earth attacks. These strikes deal 1d8 bludgeoning damage, are in the brawling group, and have the backswing, fatal d12, reach, and unarmed traits. On a critical success with a shattering earth attack, all creatures other than you that are within 10 feet of the target, including the target itself, take 1 point of bludgeoning splash damage per weapon damage die.</p>\n<p>While in Kaiju Stance, you ignore difficult terrain.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "selfEffect": {
            "name": "Stance: Kaiju Stance",
            "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Stance: Kaiju Stance"
          },
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "uncommon",
            "value": [
              "monk",
              "polymorph",
              "stance"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 8,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "mixed-maneuver.json",
      "id": "jCIBYryi6Y3JwmqH",
      "name": "Mixed Maneuver",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "jCIBYryi6Y3JwmqH",
        "folder": "vIv76ARzujbUOS1T",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Mixed Maneuver",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You leverage your knowledge of martial arts to mix different maneuvers together into a single flowing combination. Choose any two of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Grapple], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Reposition], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Shove], and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Trip]. Attempt both of the attacks you chose against the same or different creatures, but don't apply the multiple attack penalty until after resolving both attacks.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "master in Athletics"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "monk"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 8,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "pinning-fire.json",
      "id": "AiV2xFhYB90KHt2x",
      "name": "Pinning Fire",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "AiV2xFhYB90KHt2x",
        "folder": "vIv76ARzujbUOS1T",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Pinning Fire",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "reaction"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Flurry of Blows] to make two ranged piercing weapon Strikes against the same target.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You target your opponent's clothing, equipment, or loose flesh with piercing projectiles to pin them to the ground or a nearby surface.</p>\n<p>If both your attacks hit, the target must succeed at a Reflex save against your class DC or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Immobilized] until it or an adjacent creature succeeds at a @Check[athletics|dc:10|name:Remove Pinning Projectiles] check to remove the pinning projectiles.</p>\n<p>The creature doesn't become stuck if it is incorporeal, is liquid (like a water elemental or some oozes), or could otherwise escape without effort.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "monk"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 8,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "projectile-snatching.json",
      "id": "dTPVRVzfVBlBUV2l",
      "name": "Projectile Snatching",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "dTPVRVzfVBlBUV2l",
        "folder": "vIv76ARzujbUOS1T",
